This product packages, but does not vendor, the DMF Platform env tooling
(dmf-env), generic playbooks/roles (dmf-infra), and AWX launcher runbooks
(dmf-runbooks). Those are pulled at image-build time from their own
repositories; each is governed by its own LICENSE. The container image
additionally bundles third-party tools (OpenTofu, Ansible, sops, age,
rclone, kubectl, Python/FastAPI, React) — each governed by its own
upstream license.
